Package: tind-extras
Version: 0.1.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: apt, curl, gnupg, ca-certificates, debconf, libnotify-bin, jq, flatpak
Installed-Size: 4
Description: Tind optional app boxes: games, developer, entertainment and more
 Scripts for the optional app boxes: games (Steam, Lutris, Wine, Discord,
 Heroic), developer tools, entertainment, creative, communication,
 productivity and cloud (LibreOffice, Nextcloud, Bitwarden) and
 printers and scanners. They run from the installer's tick boxes on first boot,
 or later from Tind Apps. Nothing here is on the ISO; all of it needs internet.
